+/* FNX no-gperf replacement (docs/design/self-hosting-packages.md §6):
+ * the stock build synthesizes fcobjshash.h with cpp/sed/awk + gperf
+ * (GPLv3) at build time - FNX carries no GPL tooling.  The same
+ * lowercase property-name -> FcObject mapping is provided here directly.
+ * The rows mirror src/fcobjs.h (cache-signature order) - when fcobjs.h
+ * changes, regenerate the keyword list from the upstream
+ * src/fcobjshash.gperf.h pipeline (gperf --pic -m 100; the gperf binary
+ * is a dev-time tool in .build/host-tools, never a build dependency). */
